# Store every text file with LF in the repository, whatever platform a
# contributor is on. Without this, Git for Windows' default `core.autocrlf`
# rewrites line endings on checkout and every commit touches every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (screenshots.json, if one is ever added, points at these).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
